# NN-RUNTIME-2: the fully fused MLP (width 64, configurable depth, ReLU, linear output; Engine/Graphic/Neural/FusedMlp.hpp,
# Shaders/Programs/Compute/NeuralFusedMlp.shader) forward + weight-gradient kernels on all three kernel paths, checked
# against the CPU fp32 reference (RunFusedMlpReference) on a fixed seeded batch.
# Дано Projects/Desert, default scene, this Windows machine (RTX); machine.json ForcedNeuralKernelPath set in turn by run Neural "Neural: Kernel path Fp32" / "Fp16" / "CoopMatFp16".
# Когда Editor start; for each forced path: DesertCtl nn-check.
# Тогда [nn_check]: each reply names the path it ran (fp32 / fp16 / coopmat_fp16) and max abs / rel error of the outputs and of the weight gradients vs the CPU reference; rel <= 1e-5 for fp32 and <= 1e-2 for fp16 and coopmat_fp16; all 3 paths run; the "[Vulkan] device" caps line shows vulkanMemoryModel core1.2; 0 VUID in the log.
# Тогда [nn_check6] (step 6, forced Fp32 / Fp16 / CoopMatFp16 / Auto in turn, nn-check each time): every asked path is in the reply's "runs" either with "pass" or with "refused" carrying the reason (resolver refusal, or the kernel's compile/reflect reason from ShaderService::AcquireVariant); state device.nn.lastCheck lists the same paths with "pass" / "refused: <reason>"; no path silently missing; editor alive after each.
# Тогда [nn_check7] (step 7, exit codes): forced path the device lacks -> reply ok, the path in "runs" with "refused" (the resolver's reason) and "refused" in the payload, DesertCtl exit 0; a forced path the device claims whose kernel/pipeline/readback is refused -> reply error "nn-check refused a path the device claims", DesertCtl exit 1; Auto with nothing run -> exit 1.
# Тогда [shader_refusal_once] (step 7; a shader made to fail compile, e.g. a syntax error in a variant-only block of Programs/Compute/NeuralFusedMlp.shader or a forward material cell, 300 frames): the refusal line of that (shader, variant) appears ONCE in editor.log (ShaderService::ClaimRefusalReport; the compile is not retried per frame); after fixing the source and hot reload it is gone, the pass draws, nothing more is logged for it.
Когда run Neural "Neural: Kernel path Fp32"
Когда nn-check
Когда run Neural "Neural: Kernel path Fp16"
Когда nn-check
Когда run Neural "Neural: Kernel path CoopMatFp16"
Когда nn-check
Когда run Neural "Neural: Kernel path Auto"
Когда nn-check
Когда state device
Тогда nn_check_auto editor alive after four nn-check runs (fp32 / fp16 / coopmat_fp16 / auto), 0 VUID
